### Lista wnioskow
GET http://localhost:8080/applications

### Lista wnioskodawcow
GET http://localhost:8080/applicants

### Wnioskodawca id 1
GET http://localhost:8080/applicants/1

### Nowy wniosek
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantName":"Tomek Zielinski","type":"PASZPORT","status":"NOWY"}

### Nowy wnioskodawca
POST http://localhost:8080/applicants
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Maria","lastName":"Wisniewska","email":"maria@email.pl"}

### Nowy wniosek dla Marii
POST http://localhost:8080/applicants/3/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"PASZPORT","status":"NOWY"}

### Zmien status
PUT http://localhost:8080/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantName":"Anna Nowak","type":"MELDUNEK","status":"ZAKONCZONY"}

### Usun wniosek
DELETE http://localhost:8080/applications/3

### Sprawdz po zmianach
GET http://localhost:8080/applications

### Sprawdz gdy GET poza zakresem
GET http://localhost:8080/applications/99

### Sprawdz gdy GET dla statusu NOWY
GET http://localhost:8080/applications/status/NOWY

### Sprawdz czy przy usuwaniu blad 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/applications/99

###Sprawdz czy walidacja dziala gdy puste pola
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantName":"","type":"","status":""}

###Sprawdz czy walidacja dziala gdy za krotkie imie
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantName":"A","type":"MELDUNEK","status":"NOWY"}

